      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m2dcXxjdXJG0FfwHn4bpAK1W3YafJdIiKtntWoxr5Q0UM=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "India",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-15T01:04:18Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgzJECHr1QwmK1w2tSZ4AaABAg.A_WASBrel3sA_WH0tcW2nf",
          "author": "@Reallifeinsights.26",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/mMzx8SBSXsn8xBmrmQDe86A9umm57EmFhYh6gKNDivO_sXhYsjH5m93RGwEil0fHxA86U7MrBzw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "Thank you so much for taking the time to watch the video and for dropping by. It is wonderful to have supporters from India tuning in. What did you find most fascinating about life in Tuvalu from this video? I would love to hear more of your thoughts.",
          "likeCount": 0,
