    },
    {
      "id": "UgyalSRYe4cWFGK_Qa54AaABAg",
      "author": "@MohammadExm",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mNkj4pW6jUvChG4gBzsrYlBtzdpsU-SuNMu6MPKVmDoCxY2_D05vAOfPJE2IATJUm0Sw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "How they get the drinking water",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T10:47:45Z",
      "replyCount": 2,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgyalSRYe4cWFGK_Qa54AaABAg.A_UdQdvRUtpA_d7pyaIV8g",
          "author": "@AtlasDiscover1",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/7TBImWUN4TI_7J0HrYvSkuW-v_8WEUqIax90zZTUXl69j8pbt__ZlEEIT5jraDod9EzEsb7THw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "They mostly rely on rainwater harvesting tanks and desalination plants on the island.",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-18T03:15:23Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "UgyalSRYe4cWFGK_Qa54AaABAg.A_UdQdvRUtpA_WHkOXN9kl",
          "author": "@Reallifeinsights.26",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/mMzx8SBSXsn8xBmrmQDe86A9umm57EmFhYh6gKNDivO_sXhYsjH5m93RGwEil0fHxA86U7MrBzw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "That is a great observation! Fresh water is one of the biggest challenges for life on these beautiful, remote islands. The people of Tuvalu have mastered the art of rainwater harvesting, using their rooftops and storage systems to keep their families supplied.",
          "likeCount": 1,
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-15T02:08:05Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "UgzmFXFxoi58yp4dKRF4AaABAg",
      "author": "@jacksonmiller9780",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lg0yKcKABH7wlingmR_GqsKvkDTh8oAGRblK3-5io=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Having lived in Tuvalu, seeing Starlink dishes everywhere now is crazy. Going from zero ATMs to high-speed satellite internet in a flash!",
      "likeCount": 3,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T08:33:25Z",
      "replyCount": 2,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgzmFXFxoi58yp4dKRF4AaABAg.A_RpFqWOoCOA_d7mO3pgIp",
          "author": "@AtlasDiscover1",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/7TBImWUN4TI_7J0HrYvSkuW-v_8WEUqIax90zZTUXl69j8pbt__ZlEEIT5jraDod9EzEsb7THw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "That must be amazing to witness firsthand! Tech really transformed the island fast.",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-08-18T03:14:54Z"
        },
        {
          "id": "UgzmFXFxoi58yp4dKRF4AaABAg.A_RpFqWOoCOA_WHBAYjhMb",
